  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あっ、ゆゆちゃんは誰よりも早く寝ちゃってる。呑気だなぁ、ちゃんと反省してるのかなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「まぁ、悪気はなかったみたいだけど？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-alien",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-alien_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「『ゆゆちゃん』は、あたしと何度か接触していましたからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「あたしの『やりくち』を、感覚で理解していたようです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「ううん。あたしに感情移入し、あたしと同じように、夢を心の慰めにしようとした。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-alien",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-alien_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「この子、もしかしたら天才児かもしれませんね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
