    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-alien_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あぁ、そんなような感じはしますよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わたし、ゆゆちゃんの才能にはいつも驚かされてるし、やきもち焼いちゃうもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「でも、精神的にはお子ちゃまなんだよね……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「世界を丸ごと塗り替えて、過去を、歴史をねじ曲げて……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「望んだことが、『おばあちゃんと会いたい』だったなんて」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「ゆゆちゃんね、高校に入学する直前に大好きだったおばあちゃんを亡くしてるの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「最初に出会ったころは、いつも泣いて、寂しそうにダニエルとばっかり喋ってたよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「でも。いつの日からか、すごく元気になった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あぁそっか、だから『ダニエル』は『おばあちゃん』なんだね……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-alien",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-alien_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「はい、そういう理屈です。『ゆゆちゃん』は、大好きなおばあちゃんにまた会いたかった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「お化けでも、どんな恐ろしい怪物でもいいから、もういちどだけでも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-alien",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-alien_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「その気持ちは、わかります。会いたいひとに会えないのは、とても寂しいですからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「でも実際には、死者とは二度と触れあえません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「だから『ゆゆちゃん』は過去に遡って、まだ生きている『おばあちゃん』と会おうとした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「無意識的に、ですけどね。恐ろしい子……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-alien",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-alien_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「その結果として、るりの夢を起点として過去に遡り、彼女が世界を塗り替えた」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「まぁ中途はんぱにしか戻れずに、おまけに意識的な過去への遡航ではなかったので。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-alien",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-alien_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「彼女の妄想や知識によって、おかしな世界になってしまったようですけど……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-alien",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-alien_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「ゆゆちゃん、時代考証とか全然しないんです。思いつきで原稿を書くんですよ、いつも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
